{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOCUT68w","is_bot":false,"login":"ChaiXinLong-tech","name":""},"body":"Parent: #33\n/bounty $50\n\n## Scope\nAdd a focused TaskFlow API utility for detecting the Unicode left-to-right embedding character (U+202A) in a string.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Add $path exporting $(System.Collections.Hashtable.fn)(input: string): boolean.\n- Return \true only when the input contains the left-to-right embedding character.\n- Keep the helper dependency-free and safe for reuse in API validation paths.\n- Include local TypeScript proof for positive, negative, and empty-string cases.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABItPO3Q","author":{"login":"voladoradepapantla-netizen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Starting this one now. I'll keep the helper tiny and cover the requested character directly.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T20:51:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5016#issuecomment-4879273693","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABItPamA","author":{"login":"voladoradepapantla-netizen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"PR is up: https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/pull/5045","createdAt":"2026-07-03T20:51:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5016#issuecomment-4879276696","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABIz7HzQ","author":{"login":"yanyishuai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming #5016 — `isLeftToRightEmbeddingPresent`. /claim #5016","createdAt":"2026-07-05T13:53:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5016#issuecomment-4886284237","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABI0Buqg","author":{"login":"yanyishuai"},"authorAssociation":"NON